语法

    0 $accept: commands $end

    1 commands: command_wrapper

    2 command_wrapper: rule_stmt

    3 opt_star: '*'
    4         | %empty

    5 constrain: TABLEEQ LBRACE ID COMMA ID RBRACE
    6          | ATTRSEQ LBRACE ID COMMA ID RBRACE
    7          | ATTRSSUB LBRACE ID COMMA ID RBRACE
    8          | PREDICATEEQ LBRACE ID COMMA ID RBRACE
    9          | SCHEMAEQ LBRACE ID COMMA ID RBRACE
   10          | NOTNULL LBRACE ID COMMA ID RBRACE
   11          | UNIQUE LBRACE ID COMMA ID RBRACE
   12          | REFERENCE LBRACE ID COMMA ID COMMA ID COMMA ID RBRACE

   13 constrain_list: constrain
   14               | constrain_list SEMICOLON constrain

   15 pattern: LEFTJOIN LT ID ID GT LBRACE pattern COMMA pattern RBRACE
   16        | RIGHTJOIN LT ID ID GT LBRACE pattern COMMA pattern RBRACE
   17        | INNERJOIN LT ID ID GT LBRACE pattern COMMA pattern RBRACE
   18        | INPUT LT ID GT
   19        | PROJ opt_star LT ID ID GT LBRACE pattern RBRACE
   20        | INSUBFILTER LT ID GT LBRACE pattern COMMA pattern RBRACE
   21        | FILTER LT ID COMMA ID GT LBRACE pattern RBRACE

   22 rule_stmt: pattern BAR pattern BAR constrain_list


